{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19937","headline":"石淙 一 · 孟郊","name":"石淙 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岩谷不自胜，水木幽奇多。\n朔风入空曲，泾流无大波。\n迢递径难尽，参差势相罗。\n雪霜有时洗，尘土无由和。\n洁冷诚未厌，晚步将如何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19937.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19937","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}